      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems to be a repeat of ticket \"VRChat is not responding\" message randomly and disconnect\"\nEach time I disconnect my ping will switch between 180ms to 240ms and then back again. I can still see everyone moving and talking but they see me frozen and until the game produces an error and reloads me into the world. Happening to a lot of Australian and UK users at the moment.\nLast night it was about every 45 minutes but it is not always that bad.",
      "viewerReactions": null
